      <transcript>BISMAN </transcript>
      <definition>(fr. S.) T Rnam (thos) sras; S. Vaiçravana, Vaiçramana. One of the four jirtynci ji tedgygci. He is the guardian of the northern quarter of the world and god of riches, popularly known by his abbreviated T. name which is pronounced Namsray.</definition>
